famous fashion editor in the hopes of helping orchestrate her comeback. Christian faces family pressure from his father.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/krdoHrzui6ftM6IaLlMo7qEVoDi.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-19\",\"runtime\":49},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Will You Return\",\"overview\":\"Christian tends to family matters that will forever influence his aesthetic. Coco must make a deal with Spatz as Elsa's addiction intensifies.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q89oQkTHYr8KhPK2o3vyTEfPgPG.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-26\",\"runtime\":52},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"What a Day This Has Been\",\"overview\":\"Christian's major decision puts his first fashion show in danger. As Coco confronts her partners, Spatz threatens her freedom.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/67ISd4DH1A6I44iaqF6FX1Qo5YR.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2024-04-02\",\"runtime\":53}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2024-02-13\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}